roject-website","content":"ensures Node/npm are available"},"7236":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3562","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#building-phoenix-project-website","content":"runs a clean install (npm ci)"},"7237":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3563","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#building-phoenix-project-website","content":"runs full validation/build (npm run ci)"},"7238":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3564","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#building-phoenix-project-website","content":"copies build/client/ into output/"},"7239":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3565","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#building-phoenix-project-website","content":"There is no remote CI/CD runner currently executing this script. The generated output/ directory is a build artifact that must be committed and pushed with your PR."},"7240":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3566","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#publishing-website-artifact","content":"Current publishing flow:"},"7241":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3567","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#publishing-website-artifact","content":"Run ./build.sh locally"},"7242":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3568","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#publishing-website-artifact","content":"Commit both source changes and updated output/"},"7243":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3569","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#publishing-website-artifact","content":"Push your branch and open a PR"},"7244":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3570","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#publishing-website-artifact","content":"After merge, output/ is used as the website artifact for deployment."},"7245":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3571","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#local-testing-during-development","content":"Start the development server with hot reload:"},"7246":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3572","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#local-testing-during-development","content":"By default, the website is available at:"},"7247":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3573","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#local-testing-during-development","content":"To test the production build locally:"},"7248":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3574","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#contributing-how-to-release","content":"Phoenix has several repos: phoenix-thirdparty, phoenix-omid, phoenix-tephra, phoenix, phoenix-connectors, and phoenix-queryserver.\nThe create-release scripts provide a unified script to handle the release from each repo.\nThe create-release scripts are in the master branch of the phoenix repo, in the dev/create-release directory."},"7249":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3575","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#pre-reqs","content":"Make sure that the JIRAs included in the release have their fix-version and release notes fields set correctly, and are resolved.The script will query them and create the CHANGES and RELEASE_NOTES files from that information.Use dev/misc_utils/git_jira_fix_version_check.py to find discrepancies between commits and JIRAs."},"7250":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3576","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#pre-reqs","content":"Make sure you have set up your user for release signing. Details: http://www.apache.org/dev/release-signing.html."},"7251":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3577","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#pre-reqs","content":"Make sure you have set up Maven for deploying to the ASF repo. Details: https://infra.apache.org/publishing-maven-artifacts.html."},"7252":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3578","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#pre-reqs","content":"Clone the Phoenix master branch locally (the script will download the actual repo to release itself)."},"7253":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3579","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#pre-reqs","content":"Make sure Docker is running locally."},"7254":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3580","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#pre-reqs","content":"Note that Docker Desktop for Mac works, but will be slow (several hours for a Phoenix core release). Running on a native Linux machine is much faster because you avoid filesystem translation layer overhead."},"7255":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3581","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"Read /dev/create_release/README.txt to understand what the script does and how to set up gpg-agent for signing."},"7256":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3582","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"Run the dev/create-release/do-release-docker.sh -d <workdir> -p <project> command, where"},"7257":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3583","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"<project> is the repo name you're releasing from (i.e. phoenix)"},"7258":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3584","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"<workdir> is any existing directory that can be deleted"},"7259":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3585","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"The script will ask a number of questions. Some of them will have intelligent default, but make sure you check them all:"},"7260":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3586","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"PROJECT: the repo to release (default specified by -p on the command line)"},"7261":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3587","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"GIT_BRANCH: the git branch to use for release. This can be master, or a pre-created release branch."},"7262":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3588","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"RC_COUNT: the RC number, starting from 0"},"7263":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3589","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"RELEASE_TAG: the git tag the script will tag the RC commit with."},"7264":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3590","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"ASF_USERNAME: your ASF username, for publishing the release artifacts."},"7265":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3591","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"ASF_PASSWORD: your ASF password, only for non-dry runs"},"7266":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3592","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"GIT_NAME/GIT_EMAIL: will be used for the RC commit"},"7267":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3593","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"GPG_KEY: ID for your GPG key. The script will offer a GPG secret key from your key ring, double-check that it is your code-signing key, and correct it if it is not."},"7268":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3594","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#do-a-dry-run","content":"The dry-run will generate the signed release files into <workdir>/output directory.\nThe Maven artifacts will be in <workdir>/output/phoenix-repo-XXXX local Maven repo, in the usual structure."},"7269":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3595","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#create-real-rc","content":"If the dry-run release artifacts (source, binary, and Maven) check out, then publish a real RC to ASF."},"7270":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3596","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#create-real-rc","content":"Repeat the dry run process, but add the -f switch to the do-release-docker.sh command."},"7271":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3597","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#create-real-rc","content":"The script will upload the source and binary release artifacts to a directory under https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/phoenix/.\nThe script will also deploy the Maven artifacts to https://repository.apache.org/#stagingRepositories.\nCheck that these are present."},"7272":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3598","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#close-the-staging-repository","content":"The published staging repository is in the \"open\" state. Open staging repositories\nare aggressively cleaned up, and may be removed by the time the vote passes.\nTo avoid this, close\n(but DO NOT release) the staging repository immediately after deployment."},"7273":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3599","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#voting","content":"Initiate the vote email. See example here, or use the <workdir>/output/vote.txt template generated by the script."},"7274":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3600","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#voting","content":"In case the RC (Release Candidate) is rejected via the vote, you will have to repeat the above process and re-initiate the vote for the next RC (RC0, RC1, etc.)."},"7275":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3601","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Once voting is successful (say for RC1), copy artifacts to https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/release/phoenix:"},"7276":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3602","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Set release tag and commit:"},"7277":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3603","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Remove any obsolete releases on https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/release/phoenix given the current release."},"7278":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3604","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Go to https://repository.apache.org/#stagingRepositories and release the staged artifacts (this takes a while so you may need to refresh multiple times)."},"7279":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3605","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Create new branch based on current release if needed, for ex: 4.15 branches in this case."},"7280":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3606","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Set version to the upcoming SNAPSHOT and commit:"},"7281":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3607","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"If releasing Phoenix (core) Create a JIRA to update PHOENIX_MAJOR_VERSION, PHOENIX_MINOR_VERSION and PHOENIX_PATCH_NUMBER in MetaDataProtocol.java appropriately to next version (4, 16, 0 respectively in this case) and compatible_client_versions.json file with the client versions that are compatible against the next version (in this case 4.14.3 and 4.15.0 would be the backward compatible clients for 4.16.0). This JIRA should be committed/marked with fixVersion of the next release candidate."},"7282":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3608","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Add documentation of released version to the downloads page and wiki."},"7283":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3609","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Update the Apache Committee Report Helper DB"},"7284":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3610","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Send out an announcement email. See example here."},"7285":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3611","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Bulk close JIRAs that were marked for the release fixVersion."},"7286":{"id":"/docs/single-page-3612","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#release","content":"Congratulations!"}},"count":7286},"sorting":{"language":"english","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":4289,"2":5659,"3":5848,"4":6398,"5":4293,"6":2782,"7":1925,"8":4783,"9":5517,"10":1187,"11":4791,"12":4991,"13":4789,"14":1218,"15":2793,"16":4214,"17":3362,"18":5738,"19":4